{"unit_id":"superclaude1__dsh-vision-android#card-zh","repo":"superclaude1/dsh-vision-android","commit":"8a9b4f9df2adfb4c622380e98483a355bf8e34de","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-android 是面向 DSH 的视觉理解与 Android 自动化插件，注册图片问答和移动设备操作工具。它可以把本地图片交给视觉模型分析，也能截取 Android 屏幕、识别界面元素及坐标，并通过 adb 点击、滑动、输入、发送按键、安装或启动应用。还提供 uiautomator 界面层级读取和屏幕分辨率查询，便于核对交互目标。适合需要让 DSH agent 检查截图或操作 Android 应用的开发与测试场景。使用视觉功能需配置兼容视觉 API 的密钥，并准备在线 Android 设备和 adb。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:85-103","src/index.ts:125-206","src/index.ts:208-359"]}
{"unit_id":"superclaude1__dsh-vision-android#card-en","repo":"superclaude1/dsh-vision-android","commit":"8a9b4f9df2adfb4c622380e98483a355bf8e34de","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vision-android lets DSH inspect images and control Android apps. A vision model answers image questions and describes screens. adb tools tap, swipe, type, send keys, install APKs, and launch apps. Vision needs an API key; device control needs adb and an online device.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:85-103","src/index.ts:125-206","src/index.ts:208-359"]}
