{"unit_id":"superclaude1__dsh-vision-android#feature-1","repo":"superclaude1/dsh-vision-android","commit":"8a9b4f9df2adfb4c622380e98483a355bf8e34de","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-android 的功能「截图视觉识别」：截取在线 Android 设备屏幕并请求视觉模型描述界面，返回截图路径和带像素坐标的交互元素。通过 mobile_look 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:125-164","src/mobile.ts:64-72"]}
{"unit_id":"superclaude1__dsh-vision-android#feature-2","repo":"superclaude1/dsh-vision-android","commit":"8a9b4f9df2adfb4c622380e98483a355bf8e34de","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-android 的功能「设备 UI 层级读取」：调用 uiautomator 获取当前界面的可见文本、描述和元素中心坐标，作为视觉坐标的精确核对方式。通过 mobile_dump 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:166-206","src/adb.ts:82-112"]}
{"unit_id":"superclaude1__dsh-vision-android#feature-3","repo":"superclaude1/dsh-vision-android","commit":"8a9b4f9df2adfb4c622380e98483a355bf8e34de","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-android 的功能「Android 设备操作」：通过 adb 对在线设备点击、滑动、输入 ASCII 文本或发送按键，使用对应 mobile 工具操作界面。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:208-293"]}
{"unit_id":"superclaude1__dsh-vision-android#feature-4","repo":"superclaude1/dsh-vision-android","commit":"8a9b4f9df2adfb4c622380e98483a355bf8e34de","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-android 的功能「安装和启动应用」：将主机上的 APK 安装到连接设备，或按组件名、应用包名启动应用。调用 mobile_install 或 mobile_launch 并提供所需路径或标识。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:295-337"]}
{"unit_id":"superclaude1__dsh-vision-android#feature-5","repo":"superclaude1/dsh-vision-android","commit":"8a9b4f9df2adfb4c622380e98483a355bf8e34de","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-android 的功能「图片问答与截图保存」：把指定本地图片发送给视觉模型回答问题，或只截取设备屏幕并将 PNG 保存到截图目录。分别使用 vision_ask 和 mobile_screenshot。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:85-123"]}
{"unit_id":"superclaude1__dsh-vision-android#caveat-1","repo":"superclaude1/dsh-vision-android","commit":"8a9b4f9df2adfb4c622380e98483a355bf8e34de","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-android 使用前须知：vision_ask 和 mobile_look 会把所选图片或设备截图发送至配置的视觉 API；默认服务为 api.openai.com，图片以 base64 内容提交。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/vision.ts:28-47","src/index.ts:64-66"]}
